HEADER;
/*
  Component:  LM8UU linear ball bushing
  Standard:   LM-series catalogue boundary dimensions; envelope only
  Family:     linear ball bushing
  Size:       LM8UU
  Length:     24 mm
  Data source: Boundary dimensions from LM-series catalogue data; groove and counterbore proportions are scaled from the step.parts LM8UU reference envelope.
  Notes:      LM-series linear ball-bushing envelope: outside diameter with end retaining grooves and a plain bore with end counterbores. Rolling elements, cage, seals, and recirculation grooves are omitted.
  Features modeled:      body, bore, outer-retaining-grooves, end-counterbores
  Features omitted:      rolling-elements (the LM envelope has no ball complement or cage); seals (seals are not modelled); ball-return-grooves (internal recirculation geometry is not modelled); mounting-holes (LM bushings are pressed or clamped, not bolted)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('LM8UU linear ball bushing'),'2;1');
